  <h1 class="site-home-h2" style="font-size:2rem">Photograph everything.</h1>
  <p class="site-words">A Record on a paid account can hold up to 250 photos. For most jobs that means you stop counting.</p>
  <p class="site-words">Each photo is placed on the question it answers, and the same photo is never held twice.</p>
  <p class="site-words">The free plan holds up to 10 photos a Record. If you reach the limit, Quickler tells you in the chat rather than quietly dropping the photo.</p>
  <p class="site-words">Photos also keep the report honest: the picture is there next to the answer it supports.</p>
